{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming' data-target='computer\/programming' data-title='Programming'>\r\n\t\t\tProgramming\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Account and machine hygiene: password-protect the login, no shared admin access, encrypt transfers, and use ZoneAlarm or Firewall Notifier plus Google Drive Sync when the box is not yours.","label":"Guidelines","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/programming\/groovy","label":"Groovy","url":"\/computer\/programming\/groovy"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/programming\/html","label":"HTML","url":"\/computer\/programming\/html"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t\t<p>\n\t\tAccount and machine hygiene: password-protect the login, no shared admin access, encrypt transfers, and use ZoneAlarm or Firewall Notifier plus Google Drive Sync when the box is not yours.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPlease password-protect your computer (account).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Do not let other people have direct access to your account, especially in your absence<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPlace public files like music and movies in a common location.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDo not share your password.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tHave limited accounts (and not administrative accounts) for other users.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDo not transfer this software without encrypting.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>If you are working on a computer that is not yours<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFirst have an account created for you.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tInstall software in this account.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEncrypt all associated folders.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEither install ZoneAlarm Free Edition.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tBlock outgoing connections.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tUse FireWall Notifier.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Use Google Drive<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAnd Google Sync (desktop application).\n\t<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/guidelines\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/guidelines\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/programming\/groovy' data-target='computer\/programming\/groovy' data-title='Groovy' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible item_block_image_contain' src='\/computer\/programming\/groovy.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Groovy<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/programming\/html' data-target='computer\/programming\/html' data-title='HTML' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible item_block_image_contain' src='\/computer\/programming\/html.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>HTML<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/programming' data-target='computer\/programming' data-title='Programming'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/programming.jpg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Programming<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}